<div>
  <img decoding="async" width="696" height="392" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/shutterstock_1770858713.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;" /></p> 
  
  <p>
    <strong>After the price of bitcoin tapped an all-time high above the $67K handle, it then dropped below the $60K zone to $59,510 per unit. Since then, the leading crypto asset has regained some of the losses and bitcoin is still up 2.4% during the last seven days. However, a great number of crypto assets have outperformed bitcoin’s weekly rise, capturing double-digit gains as high as 65.1%.</strong>
  </p>
  
  <h2>
    Thorchain, Nexo, Near, Okb, Shiba Inu, Safemoon Values Spike
  </h2>
  
  <p>
    Digital currency markets are on the move again as the .733 trillion market valuation of all 10,000+ <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> assets is up 4.6% on Monday. BTC has jumped a bit higher during the latter half of Sunday’s trading sessions into Monday and BTC has gained 2.4% this past week. But there’s over 55 different digital assets that have outperformed BTC’s weekly gains.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    The top seven-day gainer this week is thorchain (RUNE) which has jumped a whopping 65.1% this past week. The <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> asset thorchain has a .3 billion market capitalization and 8 million in trade volume on Monday. Nexo (NEXO) spiked 61.6% during the last week and has a market cap of around $1.5 billion.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-491805" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01.png" alt="" width="2306" height="1390" srcset="https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01-300x181.png 300w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01-1024x617.png 1024w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01-768x463.png 768w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01-1536x926.png 1536w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01-2048x1234.png 2048w, https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/runeusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-01.png 2306w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2306px) 100vw, 2306px" />
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Nexo is followed by okb’s (OKB) gains which have jumped 61.5% this week and near’s (NEAR) value rise of 56.1%. Shiba inu suffered some losses after Elon Musk said he didn’t own any SHIB but the meme-currency did gather 53.2% in gains this week. Harmony (ONE) did well this past week obtaining 47.5% and safemoon (SAFEMOON) lifted 45.8%.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-491803" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44.png" alt="" width="2306" height="1390" srcset="https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44-300x181.png 300w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44-1024x617.png 1024w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44-768x463.png 768w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44-1536x926.png 1536w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44-2048x1234.png 2048w, https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nearusdt_2021-10-25_15-25-44.png 2306w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2306px) 100vw, 2306px" />
  </p>
  
  <h2>
    Ethereum Gains 9% Pushing Market Dominance to 18.2%
  </h2>
  
  <p>
    As far as the top ten <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> are concerned, ethereum (ETH) has risen 9.4%, binance coin (BNB) spiked 3.4%, solana (SOL) is up 33%, polkadot (DOT) up 5.7%, and dogecoin (DOGE) jumped 10.7%. With a $2.733 trillion market valuation, all the digital assets today have seen around $125 billion in global trade volume.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Ethereum’s 9.4% gain has cushioned ether’s dominance level this week as it has tapped 18.2% on Monday. Bitcoin’s dominance level has dropped a couple of percentages from over 45% to 43.5% on Monday afternoon.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Furthermore, binance coin (BNB) has a market cap dominance of around 3.09%, the stablecoin tether (USDT) commands 2.72%, cardano (ADA) 2.71%, and solana (SOL) 2.43% in terms of market dominance among the 10,000+ <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> assets.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <em><strong>What do you think about the <a class="wpil_keyword_link" href="https://technologymanias.com/category/news" title="crypto">crypto</a> market performers this past week? Let us know what you think about this subject in the comments section below. </strong></em>
  </p>
